cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its result tables, please cite the article in
  preferred-citation rather than this repository.
title: "NCL-PanCancer-Analysis: reproducible pan-cancer analysis of nucleolin"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, result tables, figures and run manifest for a pan-cancer study
  of nucleolin (NCL) across 33 TCGA cancers, with GTEx normal references and
  independent CPTAC protein-level validation.
type: software
license: MIT
